#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What is a quantum circuit? {#what-is-a-quantum-circuit}"
msgstr "Apa itu quantum circuit? {#what-is-a-quantum-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A simple quantum circuit is a collection of qubits and a list of "
"instructions that act on those qubits. To demonstrate, the following cell "
"creates a new circuit with two new qubits, then displays the circuit's "
"[`qubits`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qubits)"
" attribute, which is a list of "
"[`Qubits`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Qubit)"
" in order from the least significant bit $q_0$ to the most significant bit "
"$q_n$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Quantum circuit sederhana adalah kumpulan qubit dan daftar instruksi yang "
"bekerja pada qubit tersebut. Sebagai contoh, cell berikut membuat circuit "
"baru dengan dua qubit baru, lalu menampilkan atribut "
"[`qubits`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qubits)"
" dari circuit tersebut, yaitu daftar "
"[`qubit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Qubit)"
" yang diurutkan dari bit paling tidak signifikan $q_0$ hingga bit paling "
"signifikan $q_n$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Multiple `QuantumRegister` and `ClassicalRegister` objects can be combined "
"to create a circuit. Every "
"[`QuantumRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumRegister)"
" and "
"[`ClassicalRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.ClassicalRegister)"
" can also be named.\n"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa objek `QuantumRegister` dan `ClassicalRegister` bisa digabungkan "
"untuk membuat sebuah circuit. Setiap "
"[`QuantumRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumRegister)"
" dan "
"[`ClassicalRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.ClassicalRegister)"
" juga bisa diberi nama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can find a qubit's index and register by using the circuit's "
"[`find_bit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.find_bit)"
" method and its attributes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa mencari indeks dan register sebuah qubit dengan menggunakan metode"
" "
"[`find_bit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.find_bit)"
" dari circuit dan atribut-atributnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Adding an instruction to the circuit appends the instruction to the "
"circuit's "
"[`data`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#data)"
" attribute. The following cell output shows `data` is a list of "
"[`CircuitInstruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.CircuitInstruction)"
" objects, each of which has an `operation` attribute, and a `qubits` "
"attribute.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan instruksi ke circuit akan menambahkan instruksi tersebut ke "
"atribut "
"[`data`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#data)"
" dari circuit. Output cell berikut menunjukkan bahwa `data` adalah daftar "
"objek "
"[`CircuitInstruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.CircuitInstruction),"
" yang masing-masing memiliki atribut `operation` dan atribut `qubits`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The easiest way to view this information is through the "
"[`draw`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#draw)"
" method, which returns a visualization of a circuit. See [Visualize "
"circuits](/guides/visualize-circuits) for different ways of displaying "
"quantum circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara termudah untuk melihat informasi ini adalah melalui metode "
"[`draw`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#draw),"
" yang mengembalikan visualisasi dari sebuah circuit. Lihat [Visualisasi "
"circuit](/guides/visualize-circuits) untuk berbagai cara menampilkan quantum"
" circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/43a57258-3e33-4071-8a48-2bf127c8a5be-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/43a57258-3e33-4071-8a48-2bf127c8a5be-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Circuit instruction objects can contain \"definition\" circuits that "
"describe the instruction in terms of more fundamental instructions. For "
"example, the "
"[X-gate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate)"
" is defined as a specific case of the "
"[U3-gate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.U3Gate),"
" a more general single-qubit gate.\n"
msgstr ""
"Objek instruksi circuit bisa memuat circuit \"definisi\" yang "
"mendeskripsikan instruksi tersebut dalam bentuk instruksi-instruksi yang "
"lebih mendasar. Misalnya, "
"[X-gate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate)"
" didefinisikan sebagai kasus khusus dari "
"[U3-gate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.U3Gate),"
" sebuah Gate single-Qubit yang lebih umum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/653e2427-e301-4d2f-84de-1959185ace8e-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/653e2427-e301-4d2f-84de-1959185ace8e-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instructions and circuits are similar in that they both describe operations "
"on bits and qubits, but they have different purposes:\n"
msgstr ""
"Instruksi dan circuit mirip satu sama lain karena keduanya mendeskripsikan "
"operasi pada bit dan qubit, tetapi memiliki tujuan yang berbeda:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instructions are treated as fixed, and their methods will usually return new"
" instructions (without mutating the original object).\n"
msgstr ""
"Instruksi diperlakukan sebagai tetap, dan metode-metodenya biasanya "
"mengembalikan instruksi baru (tanpa mengubah objek aslinya).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Circuits are designed to be built over many lines of code, and "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" methods often mutate the existing object.\n"
msgstr ""
"Circuit dirancang untuk dibangun melalui banyak baris kode, dan metode "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" sering kali mengubah objek yang sudah ada.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What is circuit depth? {#what-is-circuit-depth}"
msgstr "Apa itu kedalaman circuit? {#what-is-circuit-depth}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The "
"[depth()](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.depth)"
" of a quantum circuit is a measure of the number of “layers” of quantum "
"gates, executed in parallel, it takes to complete the computation defined by"
" the circuit. Because quantum gates take time to implement, the depth of a "
"circuit roughly corresponds to the amount of time it takes the quantum "
"computer to execute the circuit. Thus, the depth of a circuit is one "
"important quantity used to measure if a quantum circuit can be run on a "
"device.\n"
msgstr ""
"[depth()](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.depth)"
" dari quantum circuit adalah ukuran jumlah \"lapisan\" Gate kuantum yang "
"dieksekusi secara paralel untuk menyelesaikan komputasi yang didefinisikan "
"oleh circuit tersebut. Karena Gate kuantum membutuhkan waktu untuk "
"diimplementasikan, kedalaman circuit secara kasar mencerminkan jumlah waktu "
"yang diperlukan komputer kuantum untuk mengeksekusi circuit tersebut. Oleh "
"karena itu, kedalaman circuit adalah salah satu besaran penting yang "
"digunakan untuk mengukur apakah sebuah quantum circuit bisa dijalankan pada "
"suatu perangkat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The rest of this page illustrates how to manipulate quantum circuits.\n"
msgstr "Sisa halaman ini mengilustrasikan cara memanipulasi quantum circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Build circuits {#build-circuits}"
msgstr "Membangun Circuit {#build-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Methods such as "
"[`QuantumCircuit.h`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#h)"
" and "
"[`QuantumCircuit.cx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#cx)"
" add specific instructions to circuits. To add instructions to a circuit "
"more generally, use the "
"[`append`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#append)"
" method. This takes an instruction and a list of qubits to apply the "
"instruction to. See the [Circuit Library API "
"documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_library) for "
"a list of supported instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Metode seperti "
"[`QuantumCircuit.h`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#h)"
" dan "
"[`QuantumCircuit.cx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#cx)"
" menambahkan instruksi spesifik ke circuit. Untuk menambahkan instruksi ke "
"circuit secara lebih umum, gunakan metode "
"[`append`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#append)."
" Metode ini menerima sebuah instruksi dan daftar qubit yang akan diterapkan "
"instruksi tersebut. Lihat [dokumentasi API Circuit "
"Library](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_library) untuk "
"daftar instruksi yang didukung.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/66813cae-9841-47ea-96b7-8fd7b82e9759-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/66813cae-9841-47ea-96b7-8fd7b82e9759-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To combine two circuits, use the "
"[`compose`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#compose)"
" method. This accepts another "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" and an optional list of qubit mappings.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menggabungkan dua circuit, gunakan metode "
"[`compose`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#compose)."
" Metode ini menerima "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" lain dan daftar pemetaan qubit opsional.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The [`compose`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#compose) method returns a new circuit and does **not** mutate either circuit it acts on. To mutate the circuit on which you're calling the [`compose`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#compose) method, use the argument `inplace=True`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"    Metode [`compose`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#compose) mengembalikan circuit baru dan **tidak** mengubah circuit mana pun yang digunakannya. Untuk mengubah circuit yang kamu panggil metode [`compose`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#compose) tersebut, gunakan argumen `inplace=True`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/29152dfa-2275-4bc4-aadb-82185b9e0e86-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/29152dfa-2275-4bc4-aadb-82185b9e0e86-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You might also want to compile circuits into instructions to keep your "
"circuits organized. You can convert a circuit to an instruction by using the"
" "
"[`to_instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#to_instruction)"
" method, then append this to another circuit as you would any other "
"instruction. The circuit drawn in the following cell is functionally "
"equivalent to the circuit drawn in the previous cell.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu mungkin juga ingin mengompilasi circuit menjadi instruksi agar circuit "
"kamu lebih terorganisir. Kamu bisa mengonversi sebuah circuit menjadi "
"instruksi menggunakan metode "
"[`to_instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#to_instruction),"
" lalu menambahkannya ke circuit lain seperti instruksi biasa. Circuit yang "
"digambar di cell berikut secara fungsional setara dengan circuit yang "
"digambar di cell sebelumnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/81b682dd-45cb-4492-809e-d9e8ebbf5600-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-"
"circuits/extracted-outputs/81b682dd-45cb-4492-809e-d9e8ebbf5600-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If your circuit is unitary, you can convert it to a "
"[`Gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate)  by "
"using the "
"[`to_gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#to_gate)"
" method. "
"[`Gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate) "
"objects are specific types of instructions that have some extra features, "
"such as the "
"[`control`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate#control)"
" method, which adds a quantum control.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika circuit kamu bersifat unitary, kamu bisa mengonversinya menjadi "
"[`Gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate) "
"menggunakan metode "
"[`to_gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#to_gate)."
" Objek [`Gate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate)"
" adalah jenis instruksi khusus yang memiliki beberapa fitur tambahan, "
"seperti metode "
"[`control`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Gate#control),"
" yang menambahkan kontrol kuantum.\n"

